<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
 <Document>
  <name>Cung đạp xe số 1 — Vòng Xe Xanh Mường Cốc</name>
  <description>Tuyến bám đường dân sinh (theo bản vẽ Ban điều phối). Đi: Hub→cụm Đông→Nhà thờ Bắc Sơn; Về theo đường làng (đường đỏ), KHÔNG đi đường Hồ Chí Minh. Dài ~12.4 km. 8 điểm dừng + lời giới thiệu.</description>
  <Style id="stop"><IconStyle><color>ff3ba300</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/grn-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style>
  <Style id="route"><LineStyle><color>ff2f6a0a</color><width>5</width></LineStyle></Style>
  <Placemark><name>Tuyến đạp xe Cung 1 (đường dân sinh)</name><styleUrl>#route</styleUrl>
    <LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>105.6891178,20.6226476,0 105.6887531,20.6229187,0 105.6888389,20.6235011,0 105.6882595,20.6235412,0 105.6885814,20.6240333,0 105.6886697,20.6239984,0 105.6885599,20.6236115,0 105.6954049,20.6204184,0 105.6974649,20.6209606,0 105.6983597,20.6223352,0 105.6995772,20.6221444,0 105.6997489,20.6218833,0 105.7008647,20.6217829,0 105.7067521,20.6214058,0 105.7088978,20.6180117,0 105.7080395,20.615441,0 105.7085116,20.6147984,0 105.7135756,20.6131716,0 105.7147558,20.6123682,0 105.7194121,20.6120469,0 105.721236,20.6117657,0 105.7211317,20.6115692,0 105.7147159,20.6121316,0 105.7132997,20.6130153,0 105.7084717,20.6145216,0 105.7078709,20.6152245,0 105.7049702,20.6140828,0 105.7050775,20.6123154,0 105.705571,20.6111304,0 105.7077597,20.6098249,0 105.7120083,20.6085395,0 105.712172,20.608454,0 105.711232,20.608734,0 105.710272,20.60919,0 105.709635,20.60946,0 105.709589,20.609479,0 105.70816,20.609818,0 105.70786,20.609804,0 105.707816,20.609795,0 105.706992,20.610121,0 105.706748,20.610236,0 105.706643,20.610294,0 105.706106,20.610639,0 105.705842,20.610857,0 105.705832,20.610882,0 105.705751,20.611005,0 105.705417,20.611394,0 105.705352,20.6115,0 105.705316,20.611582,0 105.705297,20.611651,0 105.705163,20.612292,0 105.705078,20.612866,0 105.705069,20.612907,0 105.705063,20.612936,0 105.70504,20.613012,0 105.704877,20.613404,0 105.704862,20.613462,0 105.704858,20.613522,0 105.704908,20.613993,0 105.704913,20.61406,0 105.704913,20.614127,0 105.704807,20.614105,0 105.704189,20.613917,0 105.703899,20.613872,0 105.703634,20.613869,0 105.703266,20.613912,0 105.702757,20.614002,0 105.702212,20.614138,0 105.701815,20.614243,0 105.701646,20.614321,0 105.700563,20.614891,0 105.700176,20.615107,0 105.699892,20.615251,0 105.699779,20.615314,0 105.699669,20.615414,0 105.699425,20.615644,0 105.699003,20.616034,0 105.698678,20.616313,0 105.698548,20.616432,0 105.698412,20.616588,0 105.698086,20.61709,0 105.697964,20.617315,0 105.69787